OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see further showers. Then
OL,7,Fvariable amounts of cloud overnight
OL,8,Fwith showers, these turning fewer
OL,9,Facross Orkney later. Fresh to strong
OL,10,Fwest or southwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright spells and occasional
OL,13,Fshowers, but more in the way of drier
OL,14,Fweather. Strong northwesterly winds at
OL,15,Ffirst across Shetland, otherwise less
OL,16,Fwindy than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
