OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith showers on Saturday, strong
OL,7,Fsouthwesterly winds. Bright spells and
OL,8,Ffewer showers on Sunday, fresh
OL,9,Fwesterly winds. Rain extending
OL,10,Fnortheast for a time on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
